I also triple confirmed with apitrace that GMS wasn't querying the GPU for the matrix getters. The calls could not be found, therefore GM is holding the matrices using its own variables as we expect.
```gml
repeat(50) draw_clear(c_red);

show_debug_message(string(matrix_get(matrix_world)));
show_debug_message(string(matrix_get(matrix_view)));
show_debug_message(string(matrix_get(matrix_projection)));

repeat(50) draw_clear(c_red);
game_end();
```

